                            <comment id="15140121" author="rdblue" created="Wed, 10 Feb 2016 00:52:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=goreckim&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;goreckim&quot;&gt;goreckim&lt;/a&gt;! I&apos;ll have a look soon. I know we&apos;ve also considered a maximum number of records to add to a row group for cases where compression is good enough that you never hit the max. That would work for a fix as well (if that&apos;s not what you did).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
